# Banking Support AI Agent Chatbot - Configuration

## Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and configure as needed.

```env
# API Configuration
API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Model Configuration
MODEL_NAME=gpt-4
TEMPERATURE=0.7
MAX_TOKENS=2048

# RAG Configuration
RAG_TOP_K=5

# Debug Mode
DEBUG=False
```

## Setup Instructions

1. Copy this file to `.env`:
   ```bash
   cp .env.example .env
   ```

2. Edit `.env` with your configuration:
   ```env
   API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
   ```

3. The application will automatically read these settings
